<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/Apple-Intelligence-China.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="brief size-full wp-image-1074767" align="left" style="float:left;margin:0 20px 20px 0;width:160px;height:auto;" /><a href="https://www.apple.com.cn/apple-intelligence/">Apple's website in China</a> says iOS 27.3 will enable some Apple Intelligence features in China, such as Writing Tools, Genmoji, Clean Up, Notification Summaries, Priority Notifications, Visual Intelligence, and Live Translation with AirPods. Select features will not be available, including Siri AI and Image Playground.<br/>
<br/>
